<title>GERMANY: Schering shares rise on DKB upgrade.</title>
<headline>Schering shares rise on DKB upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German drugs company Schering AG rose in early bourse trade after Dresdner Kleinwort Benson raised its recommendation on the stock from &quot;trading buy&quot; to &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>Schering was up 1.45 marks at 143.40 marks in early bourse trade, compared to the overall market which was down 21.98 points at 3,174.05 points.</p>
<p>&quot;We are also in the process of raising our EPS forecasts for the group,&quot; said Stewart Harris of DKB told Reuters.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
